		'<circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"/><path d="M12 2.5v3M12 18.5v3M2.5 12h3M18.5 12h3M5.2 5.2l2.1 2.1M16.7 16.7l2.1 2.1M18.8 5.2l-2.1 2.1M7.3 16.7l-2.1 2.1"/>',
